; $VER: Install-DECnet 0.3 (16.11.2026)
;
; Installer script for the Amiga DECnet Phase IV endnode stack.
; Needs the Commodore Installer (V43 recommended) and AmigaOS 2.04.
;
; Installs:
;   <drawer>/DECnet/C        dnetd, dncheck, dncopy, dndir, dnnodes, dnstartup
;   <drawer>/DECnet/L        dn-handler (the DN: file system)
;   <drawer>/DECnet/S        DECnet-Start, DECnet-Stop
;   <drawer>/DECnet/Storage  Mountlist for DN:
;   LIBS:decnet.library
;   ENVARC:DECnet/nodes      node names (kept if it already exists)
;   S:User-Startup           block that starts DECnet before TCP/IP and
;                            puts DECnet:C and DECnet:S into the path
;
; Copyright (C) 2026  Torsten Bülck (tuti)
; SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

